2026-11-05T23:58:48.5439943Z [36;1m# Note: There is currently no way to distinguish between undefined variables and empty strings in GitHub Actions.[0m
2026-11-05T23:58:48.5441384Z [36;1m# This limitation affects how we handle default values and empty inputs.[0m
